<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33526" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλεγκ-τικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fond of cross-questioning</i> or <i>examining</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Sph.</u>
				216b
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ἐ. ἐκεῖνος</span> that
				<i>cross-questioner</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				200a
			</span></i>; <i>fond of reproving, critical</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἁμαρτανομένων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1381a31
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				4.1
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. βίος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					6.191a
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					4.2
				</span></i>
			, etc.: 
				Sup.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Demon.</u>
				55
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>refutative</i>, of indirect modes of proof such as the reductio
			ad absurdum, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνθυμήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1396b25
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.Aphr.
					<u>in Metaph.</u>
					272.32
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κά, τά</span>,
				<i>means of detecting</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάθους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.Trall.
					1.15
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
